    cta: { eyebrow: "Take a site in progress: note what it has spent and the share of the work done, or simply tell us how many sites you run: we come back with that site's projected margin and what it takes to read it every week", title: "A building or public-works company running several sites in spreadsheets, or a founder in France who runs sites in Algeria without seeing them: we build your library of items, your budgets, your purchases, your timekeeping and your claims, and the board that shows the margin of every site", body: "A library of items, a budget per site, entry on the phone, a first claim produced by the software in four weeks in the example. We work from Algiers and Sétif, in French, Arabic and English." },
